msgid ""
"VR, isomorphic teleop, and DexCap. Drag teaching (拖动遥操作) is not "
"implemented."
msgstr "VR、同构遥操作和 DexCap。拖动示教（拖动遥操作）未实现。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/0-index.md:3
#: cce04bf8475d49b09216e93403285026
msgid ""
"Start with [VR](6-vr_teleop.md) or a [game "
"controller](9-joystick_teleop.md). The other pages cover isomorphic "
"teleop, DexCap, Wuji gloves, Vive Tracker, and related assists. Drag "
"teaching (拖动遥操作) is not implemented."
msgstr ""
"先从 [VR](6-vr_teleop.md) 或 [游戏手柄](9-joystick_teleop.md) "
"上手。其余页面介绍同构遥操作、DexCap、Wuji 手套、Vive Tracker 以及相关辅助输入。拖动示教（拖动遥操作）尚未实现。"
